+//! Adapted from fe-awakening-recomp 832fe86 (github.com/Zelkin1/fe-awakening-recomp,
+//! MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 the authors of the Fire Emblem: Awakening
+//! recompilation project), crates/zakuro-core/src/game_ui.rs. Changed: the
+//! USA release (00040000000A0500) is served too; it has the same English UI
+//! textures and layout as the EUR release (checked against the files, not
+//! yet in every scene in game).
